<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in Italian first</p>
<p>division after matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>5 - George Weah (Milan)</p>
<p>4 - Felippo Inzaghi (Atalanta), Marcello Otero (Vicenza)</p>
<p>3 - Abel Balbo (Roma), Pasquale Luiso (Piacenza), Marco Simone</p>
<p>(Milan)</p>
<p>2 - Roberto Baggio (Milan), Gabriel Batistuta and Luis Oliveira</p>
<p>(both Fiorentina), Giovanni Bia and Oliver Bierhoff (both</p>
<p>Udinese), Nicola Caccia (Napoli), Dino Baggio, Enrico Chiesa and</p>
<p>Gianfranco Zola (all Parma), Daniel Fonseca (Roma), Igor</p>
<p>Kolyvanov and Carlo Nervo (both Bologna), Roberto Mancini and</p>
<p>Vincenzo Montella (both Sampdoria), Marco Negri (Perugia),</p>
<p>Michele Padovano (Juventus), Sandro Tovalieri (Reggiana)</p>
</text>
